From d3cf7abe2b840782e0b4b65a99b2928798d3dd58 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Li Lingfeng <a1151488180@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 15:28:52 +0800
Subject: [RFC PATCH 1/5] msgr: add configurable role pools and live
 per-role connection placement

Add opt-in role-aware connection placement for OSD POSIX AsyncMessenger.
Split 2..24 actual workers into weighted public and other pools, and
track live reservations for public, cluster, auxiliary and
public-loopback roles.

Keep native get_worker() allocation when the policy is disabled. This
patch does not migrate active connections or balance CPU/byte load.

Assisted-by: GPT-6 (OpenAI)
Signed-off-by: Li Lingfeng <a1151488180@gmail.com>
